  "label": "Misleading Visual Metaphor",
  "description": "The use of an image to represent an abstract concept in a way that is misleading or inaccurate. The overturned car is used as a metaphor for the consequences of not spanking, which is a dramatic and inaccurate representation of the complex issue of child-rearing.",
